      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900 text-center">Why first-party data wins in 2026</h2>
      <p class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-3xl text-slate-700 text-center">
        Four shifts have moved first-party data from "important" to <strong>strategic</strong>. They are independent and compounding.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-10 grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
        {WHY_NOW.map((w) => (
          <div class="rounded-xl border border-slate-200 p-7">
            <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#616eff]">{w.n}</p>
