          <span class="font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-600">Fig. 02</span> &nbsp;Seven channels at a glance. Customer accounts, email/SMS sign-ups, and on-site analytics are usually already running. The structured-preference channel (quizzes), post-purchase surveys, loyalty, and tagged customer-service interactions are the gaps that produce the highest marginal lift.
        </p>
